    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d89">

                <pb facs="0220" n="128" sameAs="frus:frus1899/pg128"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr. Porter</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-11-21"><hi rendition="#italic">November 21,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Informally submit to French Government form of declaration outlined in inclosures
                    with instruction No. 664 of September 6, and ask whether France will join.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
